{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51453","headline":"送羣玉归别业（句） · 李寿朋","name":"送羣玉归别业（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦树有残蝉，沣浦将归客。\n（《舆地纪胜》七十《沣州》）（〖1〗作者原作「李朝士、李寿朋」。\n检《舆地纪胜》原文作「唐季朝士李寿朋」知李寿朋爲唐末朝士，非另有「李朝士」其人。\n兹删去「李朝士」三字。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李寿朋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}